## Definition of success

HCM Lite should look like a professional, carefully designed enterprise HR tool. It should use only the technologies permitted by the Beginner Track, save and retrieve real browser-stored data, calculate attendance and leave correctly, display accurate payslips, enforce the specified role restrictions within the demo, and answer supported smart-helper questions using real application records.

**Prioritize the rubric in this order: working features, correct business rules, reliable smart helper, excellent responsive UI, clean code, and a reproducible demonstration.**

Do not substitute visual polish for working functionality. Build the complete application, verify it, and only then declare it ready.